摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A shared kanban board for people and AI agents in DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1340294768","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-kanban","slug":"alpacachen/dsh-kanban","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","kanban","project-management"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A shared kanban board for people and AI agents in DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"简体中文 · English"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Get started · User guide · Agent tools"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Turn plans from your conversations into tasks you can move forward. You and your agent share one boa"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rd for planning, context, and progress, all inside DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Current plugin UI · Isolated demo data · A separate board for every workspace"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## From a conversation to the next step"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### Describe the goal. Let your agent create the tasks."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Ask your agent to break down a requirement, write implementation steps and acceptance criteria, and "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"assign labels and priorities. With 19 built-in tools, the plan goes straight onto the board."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> Break phone sign-in into testable tasks. Check existing cards first to avoid duplicates. Write imp"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"lementation steps and acceptance criteria for each card, and mark launch blockers as P0."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### See the progress. Take over at any time."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Drag cards between stages, then use search and filters to find the next task. Markdown descriptions,"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" comments, and activity history keep the work's context in one place."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| What matters | How to find it |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Important work | P0 / P1 / P2 priorities and custom labels |\n| Upcoming deadlines | Due dates, due"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"-today and overdue filters |\n| Existing decisions | Search card IDs, titles, full descriptions, and "},{"id":"p13s3","text":" overdue filters |\n| Existing decisions | Search card IDs, titles, full descriptions, and comments |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Bring the context back into conversation."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Paste or drop screenshots into a task, then choose **Create new conversation** to bring its text and"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" saved images into a new conversation in the selected workspace. Everything starts as an editable dr"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"aft for you to review and send."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Image and saving rules → · More prompt examples →"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Get started"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Desktop** — Open **Plugins**, add `@alpacachen/dsh-kanban`, and enable it."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Web** — Run the command below, then restart `dsh web` to load the plugin."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Open **Board** in the upper-left sidebar, then click the workspace name at the top to switch boards."},{"id":"p21s2","text":" Start with four default stages:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Todo → In Progress → Review → Done**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Declared compatibility: DSH **0.2.0-rc.2 / 0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.2-rc.1**, on Web and desktop. Version 1."},{"id":"p23s2","text":"10 uses newer image-preview and conversation-attachment APIs; upgrade DSH first if you use 0.1.5."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Check the Web plugin configuration"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Look for a `dsh-kanban` layer. Its presence confirms the configuration, not that the running service"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" has loaded it; restart the Web service after installation."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Explore further"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- User guide — Editing, search, images, and collaboration.\n- Agent tool reference — All 19 tools, ar"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"guments, and completion rules.\n- Data and backups — Keep both the board file and the DSH attachment "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"store to preserve images.\n- Development and validation — Node.js 26, pnpm 11.8.0, builds, and tests."},{"id":"p28s4","text":"\n- Issues and ideas — Report a problem or share feedback."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT · Built for DeepSeek Harness"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
